{title: I Know It Was The Blood}
{key: Bb}
{x_theme: cross, blood}
{x_source: chrd:i_know_it_was_the_blood.chrd}

{comment: Refrain}
One [Bb]day when I was [Bb/Ab]lost,
He [Eb/G]died upon the cross,
I [Bb]know it was the [F]blood for[Bb] me.

{comment: Verse 1}
[Bb]I know it was the blood,[Ab/Bb]
[Bb]I know it was the blood,[Ab/Bb]
[Bb]I know it was the blood for [F]me

{comment: Verse 2}
[Bb]They whipped Him all night long,[Ab/Bb]
[Bb]They whipped Him all night long,[Ab/Bb]
[Bb]They whipped Him all night long for [F]me.

{comment: Verse 3}
[Bb]They pierced Him in His side,[Ab/Bb]
[Bb]They pierced Him in His side,[Ab/Bb]
[Bb]They pierced Him in His side for [F]me.

{comment: Verse 4}
[Bb]He never said a mumblin' word,[Ab/Bb]
[Bb]He never said a mumblin' word,[Ab/Bb]
[Bb]He never said a mumblin' word for [F]me.

{comment: Verse 5}
[Bb]He hung His head and died,[Ab/Bb]
[Bb]He hung His head and died,[Ab/Bb]
[Bb]He hung His head and died for [F]me.

{comment: Verse 6}
[Bb]He's coming back again,[Ab/Bb]
[Bb]He's coming back again,[Ab/Bb]
[Bb]He's coming back again for [F]me.
